# Keep the installed app current

The Desktop/Start shortcut **Solution Arch Organize** launches
`%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\solution-arch-organize\Solution Arch Organize.exe`.
That copy does not update itself. After any user-visible app change, finish by
running `.\scripts\sync-desktop-install.ps1` before telling the user it is done.

Do not silently run the NSIS installer. Do not leave the shortcut on `launch.vbs`.

```
# ❌ BAD — source changed, installed exe still yesterday's build
# ❌ BAD — only run npm run dev and assume the desktop shortcut matches

# ✅ GOOD
.\scripts\sync-desktop-install.ps1
```

Tell the user to fully quit and reopen the shortcut. A running process will not pick up the new files.
